1
00:00:00,439 --> 00:00:03,710
易考范文二十一

2
00:00:03,719 --> 00:00:06,980
What is happiness?

3
00:00:06,989 --> 00:00:12,890
This is an age-old question that has been puzzling people from all walks of life.

4
00:00:12,899 --> 00:00:16,400
Although different people has different opinions about it,

5
00:00:16,409 --> 00:00:19,780
we all agree that it is such a precious thing

6
00:00:19,789 --> 00:00:23,180
that cannot be bought by money or anything else.

7
00:00:23,189 --> 00:00:27,650
And despite many scientific studies carried out on happiness,

8
00:00:27,659 --> 00:00:33,670
no really effective way to gain happiness has yet been found and introduced.

9
00:00:33,679 --> 00:00:39,140
Everyone wants to live a happy life and to find happiness at every turn.

10
00:00:39,149 --> 00:00:41,550
But what should we do then?

11
00:00:41,559 --> 00:00:47,020
My answer is we should do something rather than wait passively.

12
00:00:47,029 --> 00:00:51,400
Sages told us hundreds of years ago that when we give,

13
00:00:51,409 --> 00:00:54,570
we are far happier than when we receive.

14
00:00:54,579 --> 00:00:58,620
That means we are responsible for other people's happiness

15
00:00:58,629 --> 00:01:02,330
and we should take the initiative in securing happiness.

16
00:01:02,339 --> 00:01:06,490
We always have to be ready to give a hand to people in need.

17
00:01:06,499 --> 00:01:10,760
We should form a supportive network with people around us.

18
00:01:10,769 --> 00:01:15,570
Only in this way are we able to find true life-time happiness.

19
00:01:15,579 --> 00:01:19,070
Happiness is all around us in our daily life.

20
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:24,540
All we have to do is make an effort to be happy and to make others happy.

21
00:01:24,549 --> 00:01:28,700
So don't hesitate to focus on other people's happiness,

22
00:01:28,709 --> 00:01:33,950
in other words, value the pursuit of happiness for ourselves and for others.

23
00:01:33,959 --> 00:01:35,950
Remember: “Life is what you make it. So make it happy.”

